sprog_inbox_legend_workflow_text = The typical translation flow: <strong>missing</strong> → <strong>draft</strong> (as soon as a value is entered) → <strong>translated</strong> (editing done) → optional <strong>needs review</strong> → <strong>approved</strong>. A reviewer may set <strong>revise</strong> instead of approving — the translator then reworks the entry. If the source translation changes later, all languages fall back to <strong>stale</strong> automatically. Clearing a value resets the status back to <strong>missing</strong>.
sprog_inbox_legend_pills_text = One small pill per language: the language code as text, the status colour as background. Languages without a translation appear in neutral grey. Hover a pill to see the language name and status in a tooltip.
